--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Comvivo's distributed artifacts bundle third-party software. Each release
carries a CycloneDX SBOM listing every component with its licence, attested
alongside the image and the npm package, so this file does not attempt to
duplicate it.

Components whose licences require more than attribution are listed here
explicitly:

  whisper.cpp              MIT
    Speech-to-text, bundled with the voice-note transcription feature.

  FFmpeg                   LGPL-2.1-or-later
    Media decoding. Comvivo links FFmpeg dynamically and publishes the
    corresponding source for the exact version shipped as a release asset
    (ffmpeg-<version>-source.tar.xz), together with the configure flags used,
    which is the LGPL source offer.

  Baked embedding model
    Shipped as a machine-learning-model component in the SBOM with its own
    licence recorded there.

These entries are populated and verified by the release pipeline
(see docs/architecture/release.md). Before 1.0 the list may be incomplete;
the SBOM attached to each release is authoritative.
